Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.93,0:00:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,awesome treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.84,0:00:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hidden at the end of the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.21,0:00:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and anyone who finds it,\Nthe King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.95,0:00:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that exciting or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.49,0:00:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are incredible adventures\Nout there just waiting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.05,0:00:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.59,0:00:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have the courage that sail and believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we will see a glimpse of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.27,0:00:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sun rising on our tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Video Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}fedew
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.67,0:00:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.58,0:00:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when we first started,\Nwe had separate horizons,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Graphics
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Datenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sailed toward different dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.27,0:00:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have changed now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.91,0:00:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for together we found we looked\Nthrough the spyglass and see.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Quality Control
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Gab\NGalaxy 9000\NPepperjack\NScolines\NVillager\NWestfal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.99,0:01:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we know that our hearts\Nhave brought us here.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the conscious point's our destiny.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no looking back.\NTake the hell with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.21,0:01:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, we can't\Nstop all our troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.91,0:01:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though the future's\Nunclear, we still can smile.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Timing/Typesetting
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Gab\NVillager
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.23,0:01:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know we'll get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.95,0:01:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No regrets.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(24,113)}Subtitle Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(67.02,153.65)}CraigyBoi\NKustogg\NLil T\NPollychan\NYag\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.59,0:01:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every tear that we pride only\Nhelps our dreams come true.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(964,111.4)}Translation
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(1007.02,152.05)}Cee Pulse\NFunimation\NNikki\NPamkinPinguin
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.95,0:01:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and those dreams\Nare precious in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.57,0:01:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glimpse of the sun\Nrising on our tomorrow?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.62,0:02:00.29,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H181818&\3c&H181818&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(725,0)\t(683,725,\1a&H00&)}Deathpiea
Dialogue: 2,0:01:55.62,0:02:00.29,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HE5E6E6&\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(725,0)}Deathpiea
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.89,0:02:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rubber?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.03,0:02:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't conduct electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.51,0:02:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so that means Enel\Ncan't hurt a rubber person.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.07,0:02:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.35,0:02:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.09,0:02:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're no mere mortal. What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.13,0:02:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me i'm luffy a pirate and a rubber man?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.63,0:02:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I see, rubber doesn't exist in\NSkypiea. He doesn't know what it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That lightning of yours won't work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.09,0:02:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mandala
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.09,0:03:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.09,0:03:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.45,0:03:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.95,0:03:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't push your luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.43,0:03:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lightning can cause far more\Nthan just electric shocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.09,0:03:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't have to tell you that, Brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.63,0:03:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You found out the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.63,0:03:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have to do better than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.35,0:03:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see he's got that weird ability\Nto predict my moves. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.97,0:04:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what is this rubber?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.01,0:04:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.95,0:04:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This rubber man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.01,0:04:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a Paramecia!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.13,0:04:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even they have weaknesses!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.37,0:04:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gloom paddling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.59,0:04:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on a bit of a schedule,\Nso I don't have time to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.59,0:04:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.50,0:04:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's changing his staff into a blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.49,0:04:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of it as lightning in solid form!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I thought, slashing attacks\Nare your weakness! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell him that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.69,0:04:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum-gum-godlich!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.55,0:04:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.55,0:04:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Murphy, behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.67,0:05:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can move right through the gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.63,0:05:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may be immune to lightning,\Nbut not to electric heat, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.47,0:05:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.77,0:05:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You blasphemous brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.39,0:05:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, come run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.55,0:05:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.25,0:06:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not as though you\Ngrew more arms, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.43,0:06:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.81,0:06:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sightseeing on Sky Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.19,0:06:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You Blue Sea people certainly\Npicked a bad time to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.75,0:06:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am this land's god.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.91,0:06:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do anything my will desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.15,0:06:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've long dreamed of\Ncreating an ideal world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.21,0:06:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This dream will become a reality, and\NI won't let anyone stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.25,0:06:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Least of all, some wealth\Nfrom the Blue Sea world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.81,0:06:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.37,0:06:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, how could I forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.89,0:06:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were going to watch this land die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.59,0:06:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Max, 200 million volts! Party!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, horsey bird, what are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.33,0:07:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.27,0:07:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.59,0:07:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold, Maxim!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.41,0:07:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ark that will take\Nme to endless birth,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.11,0:07:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to the sacred land\Nwithout end that I desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.17,0:07:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rise, Maxim, rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.65,0:07:51.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.19,0:08:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.03,0:08:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Hurry up and beat Enel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.19,0:08:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, this arc's powered by Enel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.97,0:08:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if he's defeated,\Nit'll crash with us on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.25,0:08:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if he's gone, the Sky\NIsland's gonna be destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.63,0:08:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we stay here and do nothing, we'll\Nbe taken to some land far away in Aru!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.65,0:08:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't like our options!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.09,0:08:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, we still lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.95,0:08:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.91,0:08:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.91,0:08:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.83,0:08:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.63,0:08:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down? But how? How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sail with the crew of the\Nfuture King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.83,0:08:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So wipe that frown off, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.23,0:08:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King of the Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.47,0:08:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what domain does he lord over?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.89,0:09:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the King of the Seas,\Nthe greatest king of all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.23,0:09:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph, so you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.69,0:09:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we'll soon learn if\Nthat's true, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.15,0:09:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, look! The ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.29,0:09:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.17,0:09:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's stuck in the berth!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.61,0:09:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't go any higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.91,0:09:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.82,0:09:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's scraping away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.93,0:09:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nbefore it breaks through!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.27,0:09:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.65,0:09:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get in his way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.81,0:10:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may be from the Blue Sea World,\Nbut Luffy's still a warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.19,0:10:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A warrior's duel is sacred!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.01,0:10:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should never interfere in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.15,0:10:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The circuit to this\Nark's ultimate function
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.67,0:10:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has been initiated and\Nis now running at full
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.05,0:10:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,capacity it has a name it's called death
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.99,0:10:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pia the despair that\Nwill destroy this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.45,0:10:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.79,0:10:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chief, come quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.79,0:10:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's happening in\Nthe sky over Upper Yard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.93,0:10:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.65,0:10:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just suddenly got dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.25,0:11:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen the skies over\Nthis island look like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.17,0:11:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange. What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.99,0:11:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think something bad\Nhappened to Wiper and the Warriors?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.85,0:11:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope not,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.25,0:11:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I, too, have never seen such dark\Nclouds in the sky of the White White Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.97,0:11:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, thunderclouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.85,0:11:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using my energy, Death Pier forces\Nextremely turbulent air currents together,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.95,0:11:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which produce those lovely thunderclouds\Nyou see billowing out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.55,0:11:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thunderclouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.46,0:11:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon they will envelop all\Nof Skypiea in darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.31,0:11:36.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inside them, energy will continue to build\Nuntil it's reached its absolute peak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.21,0:11:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, on my signal, they will\Nunleash thunderbolts of such magnitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.29,0:11:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That every trace of this\Nland will be obliterated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.65,0:11:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to demonstrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.25,0:12:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That came from Upper Yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.19,0:12:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get to the ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.39,0:12:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone keep calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.29,0:12:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get on a ship and head for Cloud End.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.99,0:12:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.13,0:12:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just tease the Angels a little but\Nafter all that is my right so being a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.97,0:12:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,god makes it okay to destroy everything\Nof course everything here is mine for
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.99,0:12:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for the taking, their land, their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.73,0:12:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of that, I'll continue\Ncelebrating by taking yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.87,0:13:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This spear's been highly charged.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.95,0:13:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.43,0:13:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how, how can I defeat a guy\Nwho can predict my moves?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.31,0:13:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.22,0:13:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daze.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.75,0:13:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.71,0:13:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dodging the attacks unconsciously\Nand just relying on his reflexes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.89,0:14:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost like he's a\Nblade of grass that sways
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.31,0:14:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back and forth in the wind\Ninstead of opposing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.79,0:14:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.09,0:14:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why Enel can't predict his moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.91,0:14:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I switch my brain off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.81,0:14:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I can't attack him.\NDon't stop now. Gotta get my
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.29,0:14:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hands on him somehow Come on\Nthink there's gotta be a way
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.35,0:14:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.47,0:14:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,GUNGUN! GUNGUN! GUNGUN!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.27,0:14:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ENOUGH ON THE STUPID IDEAS!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.93,0:14:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I take it you're no fan of my Vonsular?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.15,0:14:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.51,0:14:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's to be expected. Since\Nit's the basis of my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.97,0:14:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That place should work!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.23,0:14:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what you try,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.35,0:14:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,except for your immunity to lightning,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.71,0:15:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're nothing but an\Nannoying, powerless mortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.89,0:15:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.89,0:15:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why attack the Ark?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.45,0:15:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.67,0:15:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're ignoring me and\Nattacking the ship instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.89,0:15:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.97,0:15:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're even more foolish than you appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.71,0:15:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.49,0:15:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.27,0:15:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The punches are ricocheting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.07,0:15:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not consciously controlling them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.83,0:15:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you get away again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.21,0:15:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cafe! Cafe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.59,0:16:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's charging.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.89,0:16:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.45,0:16:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.35,0:16:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.75,0:16:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a god!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.41,0:16:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,RIFLE!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.95,0:17:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.05,0:17:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ship's leaving the earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.05,0:17:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.69,0:17:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.69,0:17:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna fly away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.09,0:17:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.59,0:17:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.99,0:17:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, wait, the ship's taking off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.33,0:17:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no way he's getting back up you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.33,0:17:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the best you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.29,0:17:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make no mistake, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.15,0:17:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're gone, the world will be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.73,0:17:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once again, everyone will fear\Nme who worship me and revere me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.60,0:17:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am all-powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.68,0:17:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this world, filth like you\Nmust learn the only truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.02,0:18:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By my hand, nothing is ever impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.80,0:18:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For I am the almighty God!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.92,0:18:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up in the sky, something\Nfloating over Upper Yard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.12,0:18:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a... ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.10,0:18:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A flying ship? Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.62,0:18:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of such a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.38,0:18:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what made the sky turn dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.08,0:18:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God is on that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.72,0:18:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.63,0:18:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.98,0:18:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Board the ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vessels are leaving Angel\NIsland by the hundreds!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:18:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What evil is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.96,0:19:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those dark clouds are an ominous sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.70,0:19:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, someone is coming this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.94,0:19:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shandora!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.56,0:19:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take heed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.76,0:19:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready your ships and evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Sky Islands are doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.80,0:19:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.80,0:19:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.36,0:19:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not the blue sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.50,0:19:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look hard rubber boy on
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a falling islands despair?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.38,0:19:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Skypiea will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The angels' lives extinguished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.92,0:19:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.98,0:19:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.56,0:20:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanna bet? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.16,0:20:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The golden wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.46,0:20:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.42,0:20:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.10,0:20:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He melted it like butter!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.72,0:20:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.42,0:20:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Rubber Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.14,0:20:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you like the way\NI've evened the odds?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.96,0:20:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've simply taken the fight out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.60,0:20:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.44,0:20:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm honestly not sure I could\Ntake another hit from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.10,0:20:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I think it best.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.16,0:20:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if we sever ties.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.50,0:20:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in honor of the spirited\Neffort you've put forth,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.78,0:20:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take this gold bobble as a parting gift!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.76,0:21:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I'm finally rid of you,\Nthis world will be mine again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.56,0:21:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as it was before, and not\Na soul in the world can defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.70,0:21:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me not a soul in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.24,0:21:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're an idiot even if I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,defeat you back in the blue sea\Nthere are tons more fighters
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.10,0:21:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who can put you in your place\Nsomeone like you could Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.58,0:21:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You talk too much, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.42,0:21:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.38,0:21:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fall along with the Sky Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.80,0:21:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't win! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.70,0:21:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.84,0:21:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.52,0:22:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.88,0:22:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been around!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.74,0:22:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horsy Bird, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.24,0:22:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.15,0:22:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.84,0:22:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.90,0:22:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aisa and Pierre!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.70,0:22:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.61,0:22:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that sly little voice\NI've been hearing has a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.16,0:22:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find me, you coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.42,0:22:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.52,0:22:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're coming to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.10,0:22:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tire of this time to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.80,0:22:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God's judgment?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.10,0:23:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.16,0:23:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.00,0:23:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all my strength, he hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.62,0:23:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet, here I stand, the victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.70,0:23:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's enormous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.36,0:23:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the Ark the Divine\NSquad was forced to build.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.16,0:23:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right here, on the northeastern\Nedge of the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.42,0:23:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After the others get the gold, this is\Nwhere we're all supposed to meet up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.18,0:23:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once all of you are together again,\Nyou're planning to escape, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.12,0:23:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as we have the treasure,\NI'm not going anywhere without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.34,0:23:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.02,0:24:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're heading northeast towards the\Nseashore, no doubt returning to their ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.56,0:24:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The smartest thing to do right now is go\Non ahead and wait for them to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.66,0:24:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, they'll need me to\Nguide them back to the Blue Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.98,0:24:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm their best chance\Nto escape the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.62,0:24:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have to get to the\NGoing Merry, and fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.20,0:24:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.82,0:24:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You smell nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.82,0:24:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.73,0:24:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.80,0:24:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One minute I'm dreaming,\Nthe next I'm in a nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.02,0:24:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.44,0:24:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.82,0:24:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.73,0:24:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.52,0:24:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellarine, Bellarine,\NBellarine, Bellarine,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.56,0:24:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellarine, Bellarine,\NBellarine, Bellarine, Bellarine!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.30,0:24:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.21,0:24:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.08,0:25:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.38,0:25:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be in bed, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.48,0:25:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.60,0:25:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.82,0:25:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind that. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.84,0:25:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go where?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.18,0:25:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think to rescue Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.00,0:25:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rescue, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.12,0:25:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.50,0:25:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all coming back to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.78,0:25:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.78,0:25:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.69,0:25:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God came!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.61,0:25:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, nice, I angered God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.52,0:25:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you relax?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.43,0:25:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's long gone by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.36,0:25:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This morning and say, how\Ncan I get myself smooted?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.36,0:25:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Nami who's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.92,0:25:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the one who got kidnapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.22,0:25:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.12,0:25:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could we have been so stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.04,0:25:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all our fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.02,0:25:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's too cute for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.92,0:25:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so he took her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.66,0:25:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.04,0:26:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.06,0:26:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It... big...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.18,0:26:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,big ship... lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.40,0:26:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I only saw her for a second,\NI'm sure it was Nami on that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.64,0:26:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And while I may not know\Nwhat dangers lie ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.88,0:26:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at least she's not wearing\Nthat T-shirt anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.36,0:26:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again? With a t-shirt? Focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.26,0:26:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm missing something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.04,0:26:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are Conis, Weird\NNight, and the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.16,0:26:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but we have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.56,0:26:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji, where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.82,0:26:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To that ship, where else? Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.78,0:26:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run faster or we'll lose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.40,0:26:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My love needs us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.06,0:26:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so, um, if I'm following\Nyou, does that mean I'm going to?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.64,0:26:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.55,0:27:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need your help to get on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.14,0:27:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still have that rope\Nyou shoot out of your belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.02,0:27:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.78,0:27:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure, I'll let you use\Nit while I wait down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.66,0:27:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hurry up, you coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.30,0:27:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can it, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.50,0:27:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have any more time to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.38,0:27:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you,\NNami, my beautiful swan!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.52,0:27:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swan!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.96,0:27:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that the Archmaxim is activated,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.52,0:27:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing can save this nation\Nfrom its inevitable destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.34,0:27:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.32,0:27:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lucky to have made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.66,0:27:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Abandon all thoughts of\Nyour incompetent playmates
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.26,0:27:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and embrace the glorious\Nfuture I've given you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.74,0:27:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.86,0:27:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a swell guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.82,0:27:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But one thing's more precious than gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.84,0:27:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a treasure called friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.06,0:27:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna get some gold, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.38,0:27:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.70,0:28:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And treasure! Tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.78,0:28:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What good is owning the world's\Nwealth without friends to share it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.38,0:28:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This island is filled with riches\NI'd love to get my hands on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.22,0:28:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But sacrificing my friends and enduring\Nyour ego is too steep a price to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.84,0:28:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So your treasure is yours. I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.98,0:28:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,want it really you don't want anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.60,0:28:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.34,0:28:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Sue.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.98,0:28:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.98,0:28:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait, neither Sanji nor Usopp\Nare in any shape to be moving around.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.56,0:28:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why aren't they here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.94,0:29:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.30,0:29:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, tell me.
