Dialogue: 1,0:29:14.13,0:29:15.59,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnJanieHmkBold\pos(144,825)\fscx85\fscy85\bord2.5\3c&H1B1718&\c&H1B1718&\blur0.8}and went to that flying ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.18,0:29:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.40,0:29:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're not fully healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.20,0:29:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.64,0:29:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.86,0:30:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God of the White Sea or not, if he lays\Na finger on Nami, I'll be his personal
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.70,0:30:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I need to borrow\Nsome of your courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.48,0:30:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from home, gazing not at the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.92,0:30:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are just like the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.72,0:30:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never change as\Nyou're climbing to the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.16,0:30:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your reflection wanes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.04,0:30:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you disappear, fading so silently.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.74,0:30:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.64,0:31:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't move your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.74,0:31:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let these words guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.92,0:31:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ever look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.88,0:31:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up on your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.30,0:31:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their endless nights, they come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.96,0:31:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.70,0:31:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until you see the journey through.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.40,0:31:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may not return.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.24,0:31:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope that you learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.14,0:31:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To put your past behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.12,0:31:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just keep moving on.

